       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TRANFX01.
       AUTHOR. SYNTHETIC-CORPUS.
      * CATEGORY C: MULTI-PROGRAM CALL SYSTEM - TRANSITIVE FX SETTLEMENT ENGINE
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  SETTLEMENT-INPUTS.
           05  SRC-CURRENCY-CODE   PIC X(3) VALUE 'USD'.
           05  TGT-CURRENCY-CODE   PIC X(3) VALUE 'EUR'.
           05  GROSS-TRADE-AMOUNT  PIC 9(8)V99 VALUE 00100000.00.
           05  COUNTERPARTY-ID     PIC X(10) VALUE 'BNK-LON-01'.
       01  FX-RATE-PARAMS.
           05  FX-IN-BASE          PIC X(3).
           05  FX-IN-QUOTE         PIC X(3).
           05  FX-OUT-RATE         PIC 9(4)V9999.
           05  FX-OUT-SPREAD       PIC 9(1)V9999.
       01  FEE-CALC-PARAMS.
           05  FEE-IN-CPARTY       PIC X(10).
           05  FEE-IN-NOTIONAL     PIC 9(8)V99.
           05  FEE-OUT-COMMISSION  PIC 9(5)V99.
       01  SETTLEMENT-OUTPUTS.
           05  NET-CONVERTED-AMT   PIC 9(8)V99 VALUE 00000000.00.
           05  TOTAL-FEE-AMT       PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 00000.00.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-PROCESS-FX-SETTLEMENT.
           PERFORM 1000-RETRIEVE-EXCHANGE-RATE
           PERFORM 2000-CALCULATE-CORRESPONDENT-FEES
           PERFORM 3000-FINALIZE-SETTLEMENT
           GOBACK.

       1000-RETRIEVE-EXCHANGE-RATE.
           MOVE SRC-CURRENCY-CODE TO FX-IN-BASE
           MOVE TGT-CURRENCY-CODE TO FX-IN-QUOTE
           CALL 'FXRATES' USING FX-IN-BASE, FX-IN-QUOTE, FX-OUT-RATE, FX-OUT-SPREAD
           IF FX-OUT-RATE = 0.0000
               MOVE 0.9250 TO FX-OUT-RATE
               MOVE 0.0015 TO FX-OUT-SPREAD
           END-IF.

       2000-CALCULATE-CORRESPONDENT-FEES.
           MOVE COUNTERPARTY-ID TO FEE-IN-CPARTY
           MOVE GROSS-TRADE-AMOUNT TO FEE-IN-NOTIONAL
           CALL 'FEECALC' USING FEE-IN-CPARTY, FEE-IN-NOTIONAL, FEE-OUT-COMMISSION
           IF FEE-OUT-COMMISSION = 0.00
               COMPUTE FEE-OUT-COMMISSION = GROSS-TRADE-AMOUNT * 0.0005
           END-IF
           MOVE FEE-OUT-COMMISSION TO TOTAL-FEE-AMT.

       3000-FINALIZE-SETTLEMENT.
           COMPUTE NET-CONVERTED-AMT = (GROSS-TRADE-AMOUNT - TOTAL-FEE-AMT) * FX-OUT-RATE.
